{"id":"vod_sn_38529","vodId":"38529","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"萌菌物语","name_cn":"萌菌物语","date":"2007-01-01","year":"2007","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/9cdafbcad6f121d3784d72c875b0b817.jpg"},"summary":"今年，大学新鲜人泽木惣右卫门直保（坂口大助 配音）进入农业大学农学部，开始了全新的大学生活。其貌不扬的直保有一个天大的秘密，他能够看见存在于空气中的“菌”，甚至能够徒手抓住菌以及与其对话，这样的超能力对于农业专业的直保来说，无疑是如虎添翼，但是，麻烦也随之而来。　　作为直保的亲梅竹马，直保的秘密无疑为家中经营酿酒行业的结城萤（斋贺观月 配音）创造了不少的便利。同时，外表意外老成的学长美里熏（小西克幸）和各方面都圆滚滚的川滨拓马（杉山纪彰 配音）都对直保产生了浓厚的兴趣。在崭新的校园里，直保和各式各样的菌在一起的生活就这样开始了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:02:22","playable":true,"episodeCount":11,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YriYXsR3XX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Yip7esmmR21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GDqbyvijtR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UHCDS71bjf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/AYzPKY50WM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EuXydm2k1y1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wCF8QAsHSu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/reV6e63XJS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/t5tGRbpUKu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iDaVc0LQKb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/z36CpMeWd61/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:57.770Z"}